# #5837, the claimless advance and the split hint.
MODULE: SnapshotHonestFreeAdvanceWithOwnInflight
TARGET: SnapshotHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the free advance passes an own append still in flight, which the snapshot then captures without
PERTURBS: FreeCommit
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE

--- FIND
    /\ CloseCarried => rp[a] >= seenS[a]
    /\ \A o \in inflight : author[o] = a => o > ft[a]
    /\ rp' = [rp EXCEPT ![a] = ft[a]]
--- REPLACE
    /\ CloseCarried => rp[a] >= seenS[a]
\* MUTATION: own appends below the target need not be applied.
    /\ rp' = [rp EXCEPT ![a] = ft[a]]
--- END
